            "content_1": "<p><strong>Reniva may help with the following:</strong></p><ul><li>Reduces hair fall from the very first wash*</li><li>Strengthens roots for thicker-feeling hair over time*</li><li>Calms an itchy, irritated scalp*</li><li>Delivers a botanical blend featuring Thuja Orientalis, Hydrolyzed Oat Protein, Ginger Extract, Ginseng Extract, and Jojoba Oil*</li><li>Supports healthier follicles and everyday scalp comfort*</li><li>Free from harsh sulfates, so it won't strip natural moisture*</li><li>Suitable for daily use, all hair types*</li></ul>",
