            "content_2": "<p><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong>·Thuja Orientalis: Calms scalp irritation.<br/>·Hydrolyzed Oat Protein: Strengthens strands from root to tip.<br/>·Ginger Extract: Stimulates scalp circulation.<br/>·Ginseng Extract: Supports resilient hair growth cycles.<br/>·Jojoba Oil: Moisturizes without clogging follicles. 🌿</p>",
