        "text": "<p><strong>Five botanicals</strong>, one shampoo that actually <strong>works</strong>. Thuja Orientalis, Hydrolyzed Oat Protein, Ginger Extract, Ginseng Extract, and Jojoba Oil, covering root strength, scalp calm, and everyday shine. No harsh sulfates and no empty promises.</p>",
