    "faqs_VEwRya": {
      "type": "faqs",
      "name": "FAQ Section",
      "settings": {
        "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
        "q1": "What is Reniva?",
        "a1": "<p>Reniva is a botanical-powered anti-hair fall shampoo featuring Thuja Orientalis, Hydrolyzed Oat Protein, Ginger Extract, Ginseng Extract, and Jojoba Oil — designed to strengthen roots, calm the scalp, and reduce daily hair fall in one 300ml pouch.</p>",
        "q2": "How do I use it?",
        "a2": "<p>Apply Reniva to wet hair, massage gently into the scalp, and rinse thoroughly. Use 3–4 times a week as part of your regular hair care routine.</p>",
        "q3": "Is it safe to use every day?",
        "a3": "<p>Yes — Reniva is formulated with gentle, plant-based botanicals and free from harsh sulfates. As with any new product, consult your healthcare provider if you have a specific scalp condition or sensitivity.</p>",
        "q4": "Are they vegan and non-GMO?",
        "a4": "<p>Yes. Reniva is formulated without harsh sulfates or parabens, using clean, plant-based botanicals.</p>",
        "q5": "How much is in each pouch?",
        "a5": "<p>Each pouch contains 300ml of shampoo — enough for weeks of regular use depending on hair length and washing frequency.</p>",
        "q6": "What if it doesn’t work for me?",
        "a6": "<p>We stand behind Reniva with a 60-Day Money-Back Guarantee. If you're not satisfied, you don't pay.</p>",
        "q7": "How long before I see results?",
        "a7": "<p>Most customers begin to notice less hair fall within 2–4 weeks of consistent use. If you have any additional questions, concerns, or need further assistance, please contact us through our Contact page. Our support team is always happy to help.</p><p><strong>Support:</strong></p>"
      }
    },
